     </span></li><li class="MsoNormal"><span style="font-size: 10pt; font-family: Arial">Thurs. Nov 8, 7:30pm at <a href="http://www.cityofseattle.net/parks/centers/langston.htm" target="_blank">Langston</a><a href="http://www.cityofseattle.net/parks/centers/langston.htm" target="_blank"> Hughes Performing Arts Center</a> (17th and Jackson, Seattle;&nbsp;
